# Pre-commit gate (earliest practical enforcement of CONTRIBUTING.md).
# Fast checks only — the full test suite runs in CI, not here, to keep
# commits snappy. Anything slow or non-staged belongs in CI.
#
# 1. lint-staged — ESLint (--fix) + Prettier on STAGED files only.
# 2. typecheck   — tsc --noEmit (whole project; fast, no emit).
# 3. check:deps  — block accidental dependency downgrades.
#
# Do NOT bypass with `git commit --no-verify`; fix the cause. If a check
# is itself wrong, fix the check in its own commit and say why.
npx lint-staged
npm run typecheck
npm run check:deps
